# Used by the api image (apps/api/Dockerfile), whose build context is the repo root.
# Allowlist: everything else (data/, artifacts/, apps/web, .git, legacy files) stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/api
!ml

**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
apps/api/tests
ml/tests
ml/notebooks
